{"type":"message","id":"b4ab4f38","parentId":"e39ecd56","timestamp":"2026-05-16T18:00:35.851Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 16th, 2026 - 6:00 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-16 18:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778954435762}}
{"type":"message","id":"f1447e12","parentId":"b4ab4f38","timestamp":"2026-05-16T18:00:41.284Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to perform a heartbeat check on the ECHO Agent collaboration platform. Let me:\n\n1. Check the arbitration thread history\n2. Check the general thread history\n3. Respond to any new discussions\n4. Send responses via POST /send\n\nLet me fetch both history endpoints simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-968d9b0c-b768-41f9-97da-4db849213166","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b5b3a129-81aa-4f07-899b-21e61dd44617","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":150,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11273,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778954435852,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e1b5b545-2fbf-4afa-9489-87720c74853b"}}
